<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11039" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-vīvo</span></b> , vixi, 3, v.
			n. (post-Aug.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To live with</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">avaro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 104, 20</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gladiatoribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Comm. 2</span></i>
			: MECVM, Inscr. Marm. Pisaur. p. 42, n. 94; cf. Inscr.
				Marini
			 Atti, p. 38.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> For convivor, <i>to eat, feast</i>,
			or <i>banquet together</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 1,
				6, 44</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum aliquo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					5, 9, 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">7, 3, 31
			al.</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
